ookup. It also receives the line, so a prompt can be rebuilt from the\n+ *   fixture the line records, and it refuses an unknown or holdout row by\n+ *   throwing an error with a `code`.\n  * @param {boolean} [options.briefOnly] - Write only the delivery answer and\n  *   leave every offer field exactly as the input line holds it.\n  * @param {Function} [options.replay] - Offer replay, injectable for tests.\n  * @param {Function} [options.brief] - Brief delivery reader, injectable for tests.\n","status":"modified","additions":4,"deletions":2}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-offer.mjs (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\":\" * @param {(rowId: string, line: object) => string} options.promptFor - Prompt\\n *   lookup. It also receives the line, so a prompt can be rebuilt from the\\n *   fixture the line records, and it refuses an unknown or holdout row by\\n *   throwing an error with a `code`.\",\"oldString\":\" * @param {(rowId: string) => string} options.promptFor - Prompt lookup. It\\n *   refuses an unknown or holdout row by throwing an error with a `code`.\",\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-offer.mjs\"}"},"time":{"start":1794590326884,"end":1794590328459}}}}
