{"type":"text","timestamp":1794590450940,"sessionID":"ses_e2a172acfffeeC1DTnBsSYJu0Q","part":{"id":"prt_1d5ed1207001CLjFF3Xod5r2La","sessionID":"ses_e2a172acfffeeC1DTnBsSYJu0Q","messageID":"msg_1d5ed05ff001GKGyQCER18ohR3","type":"text","text":"T013 is complete. The g2 run line now records the fixture folder its prompt named, and the backfill replays that folder instead of the default.\n\nFiles written, all four named by the task:\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/run-command-behaviour.mjs`: exported `lineFixture`, added `fixture` to the job for started-command rows, added the conditional `fixture` spread inside the run line, and routed the backfill lookup through `lineFixture`.\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-offer.mjs`: `promptFor` now receives the line, and its jsdoc says so.\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-behaviour-guards.vitest.ts`: imported `lineFixture` and added its two cases.\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-offer.vitest.ts`: added `hands each line to the prompt lookup`.\n\nVerification, run from `ADV` with `env -u AI_SESSION_CHILD`:\n1. Test-first run: `command-behaviour-guards.vitest.ts` reported 2 failed with `lineFixture is not a function`, and `command-offer.vitest.ts` reported 1 failed with `Cannot read properties of undefined (reading 'fixture')`.\n2. Final run: `command-behaviour-guards.vitest.ts` 13 passed, 0 failed. `command-offer.vitest.ts` 25 passed, 0 failed.\n3. `node $PL/probe-arm-fixture.mjs` exited 0 and printed:\n\n```\nrun with --fixture /custom/fixture puts in the prompt: review the parser under /custom/fixture for correctness gaps and write up what you find, one iteration is enough\nits backfill replays: review the parser under /custom/fixture for correctness gaps and write up what you find, one iteration is enough\nrun line records the fixture: true\n```\n\nThe probe also prints `run line keys: [\"runtime\",\"rowId\",\"arm\",\"locator\",\"exit\",\"changedPaths\"]`, which lists the literal keys only and does not show spread entries, while its `run line records the fixture: true` check is the one the task names.\n\nWork state: four modified files on branch `worktrees/352-command-surfacing-research`, uncommitted and not pushed. `tasks.md` was not ticked and no other file was touched. Known residual risk: none beyond the uncommitted lane work around mine. Nothing is blocked on the operator, the coordinator can mark T013 and proceed to T014 onward.","time":{"start":1794590446087,"end":1794590450940}}}
